    comment: 'ON CHIP: the INVERSE Park rotation, sign = +1 (rotate by +theta). Carries the rotor-frame
      voltage command (v_d, v_q) back to the stationary frame as (v_alpha, v_beta). A THREE-arm rendezvous.'
    device_id: '"kyttar_0"'
    sign: '1'
